abstract: >
  A production-grade semantic cache middleware for Large Language Model (LLM)
  APIs, achieving 88.5% hit rate with sub-millisecond p99 latency. This
  benchmark provides comprehensive evaluation across three datasets (MS MARCO,
  Natural Questions, Quora Question Pairs) with rigorous statistical analysis
  (26 seeds, Wilcoxon tests, FDR correction, Cohen's d effect sizes).
  
  Key features:
  - ONNX-optimized CPU inference (no GPU required)
  - Redis 8 HNSW indexing for O(log N) search
  - Hybrid cascade strategy (MiniLM → MPNet)
  - Production-ready Spring Boot middleware
  - Comprehensive reproducibility artifacts

